              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-obj-malware"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Get out",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-obj-escape"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Stop by El Coyote Cojo",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-obj-epilogue"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Talk to Mama Welles",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-obj-mama"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Get a drink",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-obj-bar"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Gig type: Agent Saboteur\nObjective: Find out who is clearing the debts of the dead\nLocation: Arasaka Financial Services office, Arroyo\nDetails:\n\nElena Ortega called out of the blue. Heywood girl, her mother grew up with Mama Welles, and Jackie used to help the family out.\n\nShe reconciles community accounts at Arasaka Financial Services. Dead debtors\u0027 balances were clearing instead of freezing - no disputes, no appeals, too many of them, too fast. She reported it, and by the end of the week her access was revoked and security walked her out of the building.\n\nShe\u0027s scared, and she has nowhere to go but El Coyote Cojo.\n\nThe proof is on a terminal in the office she was thrown out of. Get in, take it, and find someone who can read it.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-gig-brief"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "V, baby. Cracked your ledger. Ain\u0027t accounting, it\u0027s a kill list.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-nix-msg-1"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Way it works, ya feel? Arasaka writes a life policy on a debtor who can\u0027t pay. Debtor dies, policy pays out, balance clears. Every account ya sent me, same shape.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-nix-msg-2"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "An\u0027 one hand signs \u0027em all. HOSHINO. Vice President, Arasaka Financial Services. Runnin\u0027 it off the books, so this here\u0027s his racket, not theirs.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-nix-msg-3"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "He\u0027s holed up at the Arasaka estate, North Oak. Zippin\u0027 ya the location. Watch your back, V.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-nix-msg-4"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Ennies received. Throwin\u0027 in a lil\u0027 somethin\u0027 extra: malware, attached. Plug it into his terminal at the estate and his network eats itself, and we take a taste on the way out. Consider it a tip jar.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-nix-msg-5"
            },
            {
              "$type": "localizationPersistenceOnScreenEntry",
              "femaleVariant": "Got it. I owe you.",
              "maleVariant": "",
              "primaryKey": "0",
              "secondaryKey": "cc-g01-nix-reply"
            },
